title: room.enter
---
<<if not $sawStreet>>
Fog swallows the street. A hansom waits at the kerb, its lamps two blurs of light.
<<set $sawStreet to true>>
<<endif>>
===

title: room.look
---
Baker Street at night, or as much of it as the fog allows.
===

title: cab.look
---
A hansom, the horse steaming in the cold.
===

title: cab.do
---
<<walk hero 205 168>>
Hero: Clerkenwell, cabby, and quickly.
Watson: There's a sovereign in it if you can find the way in this.
<<sound 131 wait>>
<<room 102>>
