title: lamp.look
---
The gas lamp makes a small room of light in the fog.
===

title: door221.look
---
The door of 221B. Mrs Hudson's lamp still burns in the hall.
===

title: door221.do
---
Hero: No time for that now. Thorne has been gone a night already.
===

title: watson.look
---
Watson, collar up against the fog.
===

title: watson.talk
---
Watson: Clerkenwell at this hour. The cabby will want double.
===
